        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion L4, Smooth Grab Victorian Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe intricate scrolling detail of this Fusion made handleset adds an elegance instead of gaudiness. Available in 6 finishes, this solid brass Victorian Handleset will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Ornate Solid Brass Fusion L4 Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass forging and casting.</li>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist that eliminates \"knob wobble\".</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion L4 Victorian Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Height: 17-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Height 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and a turn knob on the inside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> This is a non-functional piece for looks only used to match trim for inactive door. It does not latch and it does not lock.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Victorian Smooth Grab Handleset, Fusion L4",
                "description": "Smooth Grab Victorian Handleset Fusion L4 - The intricate scrolling detail of this Fusion made handleset adds an elegance instead of gaudiness. Available in 6 finishes, this solid brass Victorian Handleset will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches.",
